OL,3,GNEWSAAirliner narrowly misses gliders
OL,4,Aon approach to Luton
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe controllers "looked at one another
OL,7,Fin disbelief" when the pilot confirmed
OL,8,Fthe one of the gliders was at the same
OL,9,Fheight in the air, or "500ft higher
OL,10,Fthan the delegated operating altitude".
